BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.180 0.220 0.280 rg 44.00 525.50 Td (- ATF \(Attention-based Task Fusion\): Formula: output = task_feat + Sigmoid\(MLP\(task, context\)\) * MLP\(task, context\). Isse) Tj ET
