BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.180 0.220 0.280 rg 44.00 287.50 Td (- Hungarian Bipartite Matcher: Model 64 queries predict karta hai, jabki ground truth mein shayad sirf 2 interactions hon.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.180 0.220 0.280 rg 44.00 275.50 Td (Hungarian algorithm \(scipy linear_sum_assignment\) lowest matching cost ke hisab se optimal 1-to-1 pair find karta hai.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.180 0.220 0.280 rg 44.00 263.50 Td (- Object Classification Loss \(loss_obj_ce\): Standard Cross-Entropy Loss with relative background / no-object coefficient) Tj ET
