BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.180 0.220 0.280 rg 44.00 239.50 Td (- Verb Classification Loss \(loss_verb_ce\): Focal Loss with alpha = 0.5 to tackle extreme class imbalance across 117 actions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.180 0.220 0.280 rg 44.00 227.50 Td (Focuses on hard/rare action samples.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.180 0.220 0.280 rg 44.00 215.50 Td (- Bounding Box L1 Loss \(loss_sub_bbox, loss_obj_bbox\): Smooth L1 loss on normalized center coordinates and width/height for) Tj ET
