BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.180 0.220 0.280 rg 44.00 179.50 Td (convergence even when predicted and ground truth boxes do not initially overlap.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.180 0.220 0.280 rg 44.00 167.50 Td (- Auxiliary Loss at Every Decoder Layer: All intermediate 6 decoder layers calculate auxiliary losses to enforce strong) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.180 0.220 0.280 rg 44.00 155.50 Td (gradient flow and faster convergence.) Tj ET
